chapter.v:
just as 


those who, 


from the beginning were eyewitnesses and ministers of the word have delivered them to us,

for he 


has looked, 


on the humble estate of his servant. For behold, from now on all generations will call me blessed;

He has 


shown strength, 


with his arm; he has scattered the proud in the thoughts of their hearts;

he has 


brought down, 


the mighty from their thrones and exalted those of humble estate;

that we 


should be, 


saved from our enemies and from the hand of all who hate us;

that we, 


being delivered, 


from the hand of our enemies, might serve him without fear,
